<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">soredemo bokura shinpuru na omoi wo tsutaetai dake na no</font></font></b></font></font>

6
00:00:20,870 --> 00:00:28,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">I just want to convey my simple thoughts</font></font></b></font></font>

7
00:00:28,510 --> 00:00:34,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">fukinukeru kusunda ano hi no kaze wa</font></font></b></font></font>

8
00:00:28,510 --> 00:00:34,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">that day's faint wind blows away</font></font></b></font></font>

9
00:00:34,180 --> 00:00:39,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">kinou no haikyo ni uchi sutete</font></font></b></font></font>

10
00:00:34,180 --> 00:00:39,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">at the castle ruins of yesterday</font></font></b></font></font>

11
00:00:39,180 --> 00:00:43,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">kimi to warau ima wo ikiru no da</font></font></b></font></font>

12
00:00:39,180 --> 00:00:43,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">I'll laugh with you and live for the moment</font></font></b></font></font>

13
00:00:45,320 --> 00:00:53,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">soredemo ano dekigoto ga kimi wo kurushimeru daro</font></font></b></font></font>

14
00:00:45,320 --> 00:00:53,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">still that incident will continue to trouble you, right?</font></font></b></font></font>

15
00:00:53,000 --> 00:00:56,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">dakarakoso sayonara nanda</font></font></b></font></font>

16
00:00:53,000 --> 00:00:56,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">that's why it must be good-bye</font></font></b></font></font>

17
00:00:56,970 --> 00:01:04,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">konomama nanimo nokorazu ni anata to wakachiau dake</font></font></b></font></font>

18
00:00:56,970 --> 00:01:04,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">leaving nothing behind, let us share what is left</font></font></b></font></font>

19
00:01:04,280 --> 00:01:11,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">yagate bokura wa sore ga subetee dato kigatsuite</font></font></b></font></font>

20
00:01:04,280 --> 00:01:11,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">in time, we'll realize that it was everything</font></font></b></font></font>

21
00:01:11,320 --> 00:01:18,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">kanashimi wa hoo wo tsutatte namida no kawa ni naru dake</font></font></b></font></font>

22
00:01:11,320 --> 00:01:18,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">and sadness will touch our cheeks, creating a river of tears</font></font></b></font></font>

23
00:01:18,490 --> 00:01:27,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">yureru omoi wa tsuyoi uzu ni n<font color="#ffffff">atte tokeau no yo</font></font></font></b></font></font>

24
00:01:18,490 --> 00:01:27,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">Trembling thoughts swept into a vortex and melting away</font></font></b></font></font>

25
00:01:49,250 --> 00:01:51,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's close.</font>

26
00:02:02,180 --> 00:02:03,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's strange.</font>

27
00:02:04,600 --> 00:02:07,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There hasn't been even
one trap set for a while...</font>

28
00:02:08,310 --> 00:02:10,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shikamaru, what do you think?</font>

29
00:02:12,320 --> 00:02:14,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We're being underestimated.</font>

30
00:02:15,440 --> 00:02:20,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Those guys think the only one
following them is that big guy.</font>

31
00:02:21,240 --> 00:02:23,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They don't need to set
a trap on their man.</font>

32
00:02:24,080 --> 00:02:27,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How dare they underestimate us!</font>

33
00:02:28,000 --> 00:02:29,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It seems you're right.</font>

34
00:02:30,790 --> 00:02:33,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We are being
completely underestimated.</font>

35
00:02:34,920 --> 00:02:38,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However, this is our chance.</font>

36
00:02:41,430 --> 00:02:45,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah... We'll take them by surprise.</font>

37
00:02:48,850 --> 00:02:54,610
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Your Opponent</font>

38
00:02:48,850 --> 00:02:54,610
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">is me!</font>

39
00:03:07,910 --> 00:03:09,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That Jirobo is late.</font>

40
00:03:10,620 --> 00:03:13,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, he's already here.</font>

41
00:03:18,840 --> 00:03:22,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Aw c'mon, what took you so long?</font>

42
00:03:22,840 --> 00:03:24,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sorry.</font>

43
00:03:24,970 --> 00:03:28,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It took time to eat the scums' Chakra.</font>

44
00:03:30,440 --> 00:03:33,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey fatso, don't you dare drag!</font>

45
00:03:34,440 --> 00:03:36,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hurry up and carry that coffin...</font>

46
00:03:36,820 --> 00:03:40,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's your job you vulgar swine.</font>

47
00:03:41,240 --> 00:03:42,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I know.</font>

48
00:03:47,200 --> 00:03:51,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What Jirobo...
You're awfully easygoing today.</font>

49
00:03:52,580 --> 00:03:53,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What do you mean?</font>

50
00:03:55,040 --> 00:03:58,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm just saying I'm not handing you
the coffin.</font>

51
00:03:59,010 --> 00:04:01,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Because you're not Jirobo!</font>

52
00:04:10,020 --> 00:04:11,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This time let me do it.</font>

53
00:04:12,100 --> 00:04:15,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakon, Tayuya, you guys go ahead!</font>

54
00:04:21,320 --> 00:04:25,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Jirobo always corrects
Tayuya's choice of words.</font>

55
00:04:29,540 --> 00:04:31,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Heh, I see.</font>

56
00:04:33,250 --> 00:04:35,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ninja Art: Spider Web Net.</font>

57
00:04:44,880 --> 00:04:47,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You!</font>

58
00:04:53,230 --> 00:04:54,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ninja Art: Spiral Spider Web</font>

59
00:05:00,440 --> 00:05:01,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

60
00:05:01,900 --> 00:05:03,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now Kiba, Akamaru!</font>

61
00:05:04,200 --> 00:05:07,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He shouldn't be able to
move in mid-air.</font>

62
00:05:09,160 --> 00:05:10,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fang Over Fang!</font>

63
00:05:17,630 --> 00:05:18,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't let you get away!</font>

64
00:05:21,170 --> 00:05:23,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's my line.</font>

65
00:05:23,970 --> 00:05:25,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Look at your feet.</font>

66
00:05:28,680 --> 00:05:29,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You!</font>

67
00:05:30,010 --> 00:05:33,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's too soon for you to think
you captured us with a thing like this!</font>

68
00:05:35,770 --> 00:05:36,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shut up!</font>

69
00:05:38,940 --> 00:05:43,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">C'mon what the hell is
that fatso doing dammit!</font>

70
00:05:43,900 --> 00:05:48,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It was a mistake to leave
behind the weakest of us after all.</font>

71
00:06:01,590 --> 00:06:02,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Got it.</font>

72
00:06:11,890 --> 00:06:13,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Neji!
— What?!</font>

73
00:06:15,020 --> 00:06:17,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Me, Naruto, Kiba, and Neji...</font>

74
00:06:17,480 --> 00:06:19,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even though we've followed the plan
it's no good.</font>

75
00:06:36,160 --> 00:06:38,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm going to cocoon you.</font>

76
00:06:44,460 --> 00:06:45,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn!</font>

77
00:06:50,180 --> 00:06:52,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it! Damn it!</font>

78
00:06:52,600 --> 00:06:55,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's with this thread?! It won't cut.</font>

79
00:07:01,020 --> 00:07:02,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's useless.</font>

80
00:07:02,860 --> 00:07:06,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My thread is so strong that
even if two elephants pulled away</font>

81
00:07:06,150 --> 00:07:08,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it wouldn't break.</font>

82
00:07:12,240 --> 00:07:14,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shadow Clone... Interesting.</font>

83
00:07:26,880 --> 00:07:28,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The thread is sticking...</font>

84
00:07:29,340 --> 00:07:31,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This stickiness is probably made</font>

85
00:07:31,880 --> 00:07:35,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">by mixing Chakra with
his special body fluid.</font>

86
00:07:36,180 --> 00:07:40,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Moreover this strength. Even after
it's been released from his hands...</font>

87
00:07:40,310 --> 00:07:43,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Chakra's continuously flowing
in the thread.</font>

88
00:07:45,310 --> 00:07:50,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's impossible...
The level of the Jutsu is unrealistic.</font>

89
00:07:52,820 --> 00:07:55,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Calm down... Just calm down...</font>

90
00:07:57,370 --> 00:07:58,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">my Chakra.</font>

91
00:08:14,760 --> 00:08:17,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ninja Art:
Gum Style Spider Thread.</font>

92
00:08:18,350 --> 00:08:20,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's a different color than
the thread from before.</font>

93
00:08:21,680 --> 00:08:22,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's he gonna do?</font>

94
00:08:33,650 --> 00:08:35,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's quickly solidifying, huh...</font>

95
00:08:38,580 --> 00:08:41,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You are the first one
so it's like a little entertainment.</font>

96
00:08:42,160 --> 00:08:46,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now I'll play a game to see
which of you is the real one.</font>

97
00:08:46,290 --> 00:08:47,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What did you say?!</font>

98
00:08:49,210 --> 00:08:52,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">First is... you at the end.</font>

99
00:08:54,680 --> 00:08:55,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

100
00:08:58,850 --> 00:09:02,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It was a clone, huh.
Well, this one next!</font>

101
00:09:08,610 --> 00:09:10,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What a lucky guy.</font>

102
00:09:11,030 --> 00:09:15,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Next I'll do two at a time.
The odds are 2 to 1.</font>

103
00:09:31,210 --> 00:09:36,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This guy has great luck
but it's either one or the other now!</font>

104
00:09:48,100 --> 00:09:50,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Turns out he made it to the last.</font>

105
00:09:51,440 --> 00:09:57,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, it was fun as a game
but now the game's over.</font>

106
00:10:02,370 --> 00:10:03,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Die!</font>

107
00:10:06,710 --> 00:10:08,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The first one is done.</font>

108
00:10:10,330 --> 00:10:11,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

109
00:10:25,390 --> 00:10:29,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see the real body made
its shadow clones get caught</font>

110
00:10:29,310 --> 00:10:32,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and hid himself and
waited for a chance, huh.</font>

111
00:10:33,610 --> 00:10:37,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For a small fish like that to make
such a plan in those circumstances...</font>

112
00:10:38,320 --> 00:10:41,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're not too bad... but...</font>

113
00:10:47,540 --> 00:10:49,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're at the end of the line. Die!</font>

114
00:10:53,130 --> 00:10:54,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

115
00:10:54,670 --> 00:10:57,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto, your stall was helpful.</font>

116
00:10:57,800 --> 00:10:58,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Neji!</font>

117
00:11:00,720 --> 00:11:04,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You... How...?!</font>

118
00:11:07,520 --> 00:11:10,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Substance with Chakra base...</font>

119
00:11:11,100 --> 00:11:13,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's meaningless in front
of Gentle Fist</font>

120
00:11:13,190 --> 00:11:15,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that destroys by pouring
Chakra through.</font>

121
00:11:16,900 --> 00:11:18,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That guy's Jutsu...</font>

122
00:11:20,820 --> 00:11:23,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Evidently I'm the only one
who can fight it.</font>

123
00:11:26,330 --> 00:11:27,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Go!</font>

124
00:11:29,040 --> 00:11:30,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll take care of this.</font>

125
00:11:50,730 --> 00:11:53,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's wrong? Hey Akamaru.</font>

126
00:11:55,020 --> 00:11:58,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Apparently this guy's stronger
than the fatso before.</font>

127
00:11:59,820 --> 00:12:01,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Quite a bit stronger.</font>

128
00:12:08,080 --> 00:12:10,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If we're not prepared for
"one person, one kill"</font>

129
00:12:10,450 --> 00:12:11,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">then it's not going to work out.</font>

130
00:12:13,080 --> 00:12:14,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's what you said earlier.</font>

131
00:12:15,170 --> 00:12:18,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah, that's right.</font>

132
00:12:19,630 --> 00:12:23,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Plus we won't be able to catch up
with Sasuke if we stall here.</font>

133
00:12:24,180 --> 00:12:26,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Choji hasn't come back either.</font>

134
00:12:33,060 --> 00:12:34,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The reason we're doing this</font>

135
00:12:34,940 --> 00:12:37,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">is because of the mission
to bring back Sasuke.</font>

136
00:12:38,570 --> 00:12:40,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But that's not all.</font>

137
00:12:41,030 --> 00:12:44,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What we are after and trying
to protect is the bond</font>

138
00:12:44,360 --> 00:12:47,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">of the Shinobi of
the Village Hidden in the Leaves.</font>

139
00:12:49,160 --> 00:12:54,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do you remember Iruka's words
at the Third Hokage's funeral?</font>

140
00:13:01,710 --> 00:13:08,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Iruka-sensei, why do people risk
their lives for others?</font>

141
00:13:13,270 --> 00:13:16,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When someone dies</font>

142
00:13:18,150 --> 00:13:22,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">they depart with their past,
present, and future.</font>

143
00:13:23,110 --> 00:13:26,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Many people die on missions
or at war.</font>

144
00:13:27,070 --> 00:13:31,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And their death is surprisingly
unceremonious... they simply die.</font>

145
00:13:32,330 --> 00:13:34,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hayate was one of those people.</font>

146
00:13:35,250 --> 00:13:39,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Those who die have dreams
and goals too...</font>

147
00:13:40,040 --> 00:13:44,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But everyone has things that
are equally important.</font>

148
00:13:45,720 --> 00:13:50,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Parents, siblings, friends, lovers...
Those who are dear to them.</font>

149
00:13:50,430 --> 00:13:52,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the people important to you.</font>

150
00:13:53,520 --> 00:13:56,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The connection to the people
you trust and help mutually</font>

151
00:13:56,440 --> 00:14:00,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the people important to you
from the day you were born.</font>

152
00:14:02,270 --> 00:14:06,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And the thread that
connects you and your people</font>

153
00:14:06,570 --> 00:14:08,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">gets stronger through time.</font>

154
00:14:10,280 --> 00:14:11,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's not a theory.</font>

155
00:14:12,660 --> 00:14:16,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's what a person does
as the thread is established</font>

156
00:14:16,960 --> 00:14:18,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">because they're important to you...</font>

157
00:14:26,090 --> 00:14:30,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Look, Sasuke is heading
towards Orochimaru.</font>

158
00:14:30,970 --> 00:14:34,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We can't let Orochimaru get
a hold of someone from our village.</font>

159
00:14:35,810 --> 00:14:36,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Absolutely not.</font>

160
00:14:38,810 --> 00:14:40,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And...</font>

161
00:14:54,200 --> 00:14:55,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto...</font>

162
00:14:57,580 --> 00:15:00,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your eyes are better than mine.</font>

163
00:15:06,800 --> 00:15:07,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right now Sasuke is...</font>

164
00:15:11,720 --> 00:15:13,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">in the darkness.</font>

165
00:15:23,560 --> 00:15:27,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hurry up and go!
I'll catch up with you all!</font>

166
00:15:30,200 --> 00:15:31,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Gotcha!</font>

167
00:15:33,570 --> 00:15:35,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay! Let's go!</font>

168
00:15:36,490 --> 00:15:39,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You along with Choji
be sure to catch up!</font>

169
00:15:40,790 --> 00:15:41,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah...</font>

170
00:15:54,220 --> 00:15:57,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Neji, be absolutely sure to catch up!</font>

171
00:16:02,440 --> 00:16:04,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Heh... think I'll let them get away?!</font>

172
00:16:06,940 --> 00:16:07,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Byakugan!</font>

173
00:16:15,070 --> 00:16:16,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here it comes!</font>

174
00:16:28,210 --> 00:16:30,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This guy's pretty good...</font>

175
00:16:34,470 --> 00:16:35,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Neji!</font>

176
00:16:35,840 --> 00:16:37,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's Neji all right!</font>

177
00:16:40,060 --> 00:16:43,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Not yet...
I won't let you escape that easily!</font>

178
00:16:46,810 --> 00:16:48,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't let you go any further from here!</font>

179
00:16:54,240 --> 00:16:55,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's useless.</font>

180
00:16:59,410 --> 00:17:00,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, that's fine.</font>

181
00:17:01,370 --> 00:17:05,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It seems you're the strongest
out of the lot.</font>

182
00:17:08,460 --> 00:17:12,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Aw man, now I wanna play...</font>

183
00:17:13,050 --> 00:17:16,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's such a waste if
a game isn't played little by little.</font>

184
00:17:39,530 --> 00:17:42,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For starters,
I'll play and kill you in three minutes.</font>

185
00:18:44,100 --> 00:18:45,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I got you.</font>

186
00:18:49,310 --> 00:18:56,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're pretty good at handling Chakra
and you've got sharp eyes.</font>

187
00:18:57,030 --> 00:18:59,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You release Chakra from
the Chakra points in your hands</font>

188
00:18:59,910 --> 00:19:01,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">like a sharp needle.</font>

189
00:19:02,030 --> 00:19:06,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You see the thin part of the thread
with Chakra running through it and attack.</font>

190
00:19:10,830 --> 00:19:13,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see, I've heard from Orochimaru-sama...</font>

191
00:19:13,630 --> 00:19:16,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is what's called Gentle Fist, isn't it?</font>

192
00:19:18,840 --> 00:19:21,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But if you can't use
those annoying hands</font>

193
00:19:21,930 --> 00:19:24,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">they can't cut my threads either.</font>

194
00:19:27,600 --> 00:19:32,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Man, games the instant you know
